        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(i) An employee who is notified under subparagraph (A) of being the subject of a proposed adverse action under paragraph (1) is entitled to 10 days following such notification to answer and furnish evidence in support of the answer."
